{
  "ja245:1.1": "Times devours all beings ",
  "ja245:1.2": "including its very own self, ",
  "ja245:1.3": "That being who devours time, ",
  "ja245:1.4": "roasts the roaster of beings. ",
  "ja245:2.1": "Many people have heads ",
  "ja245:2.2": "and hair growing on them, ",
  "ja245:2.3": "(Which are) fastened on necks, ",
  "ja245:2.4": "and someone here has ears. "
}
